{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"c837f467a020938eec4ea2e106f9662e4fc510f07ebe6c3afbf22ab35e3647fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":196},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["何西阿和那不貞的婦人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說：「你再去愛一個淫婦，就是她情人所愛的；好像以色列人，雖然偏向別神，喜愛葡萄餅，耶和華還是愛他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我便用銀子十五舍客勒，大麥一賀梅珥半，買她歸我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我對她說：「你當多日為我獨居，不可行淫，不可歸別人為妻，我向你也必這樣。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以色列人也必多日獨居，無君王，無首領，無祭祀，無柱像，無以弗得，無家中的神像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["後來以色列人必歸回",{"noteId":10},"，尋求他們的上帝－耶和華和他們的王大衛。在末後的日子，必以敬畏的心歸向耶和華，領受他的恩惠。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：回心轉意","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HOS/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}